      "author": "littlexsparkee",
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-09T13:27:05.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://www.thenationalnews.com/resizer/v2/X5MKB4HRPD5DRDF4JXJBN7ZWEU.jpg?smart=true&auth=c7c9f11a83ee972c7732c80c55dae79f4ed064ea89798d09798f6c339e1e505e&width=800&height=450",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.thenationalnews.com/business/energy/2026/07/06/syrias-solar-boom-is-redefining-middle-easts-energy-model/",
