      "publishedAt": "2026-07-08T05:25:35.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://noma.security/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2026-06-29-at-14.16.35.png",
      "originalUrl": "https://noma.security/blog/gitlost-how-we-tricked-githubs-ai-agent-into-leaking-private-repos/",
