      "id": "theverge-2026-07-02-the-best-july-4th-sales-we-found-so-far",
      "title": "The best July 4th sales we found so far",
      "summary": "July 4th sales are typically a precursor to what we’d see during a mid-July Prime Day, but obviously things are flipped around this year. Last week’s big Prime Day sale is over, yet there are a number of familiar deals still poking around in the week leading up to the nation’s birthday. Best Buy is hosting its own 4th of July sale, for example. And, if you’re on the hunt for tech and gear for the ",
      "body": "July 4th sales are typically a precursor to what we’d see during a mid-July Prime Day, but obviously things are flipped around this year. Last week’s big Prime Day sale is over, yet there are a number of familiar deals still poking around in the week leading up to the nation’s birthday. Best Buy is hosting its own 4th of July sale, for example. And, if you’re on the hunt for tech and gear for the outdoors, REI is hosting a sale on products that will last through the week. There are even some Apple deals you can get, some of which are selling at pre-price hike levels.\nWe’ll be logging the best July 4th sales we find this week below, keeping the list updated with notable discounts as we spot them.\n[Product: Asus ROG Falcata | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fasus-rog-falcata-75-wireless-magnetic-hall-effect-rgb-ergonomic-gaming-keyboard-with-hot-swappable-rog-hfx-v2-switches-black%2FJJGHGPCRRZ]\n[Product: 11-inch iPad Air M3 | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-11-inch-ipad-air-m3-chip-built-for-apple-intelligence-wi-fi-cellular-128gb-space-gray-unlocked%2FJJGCQ8VCFQ]\n[Product: LG C5 OLED TV | https://www.amazon.com/LG-Upscaling-Filmmaker-Orchestra-OLED77C5PUA/dp/B0DYQM4BDB/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Flg-65-class-c5-series-oled-evo-ai-4k-uhd-smart-webos-tv-2025%2FJJ8VPZTRG6]\n[Product: Apple AirTags (second-generation) | https://www.amazon.com/Apple-AirTag-2nd-Generation-Precision/dp/B0GJTXVN9Z?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-airtag-4-pack-2nd-generation-2026-white%2FJJGCQLTTF3, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.costco.com%2Fp%2F-%2Fapple-airtag-2nd-generation-4-pack-includes-additional-airtag-1-pack-2nd-generation%2F4000277035]\n