Mechanical-Double-Rail-Bluetooth-Compatible/dp/B0DCVQBMVP?ref_=ast_sto_dp&tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FKeychron-K2-HE-Rapid-Trigger-Wireless-Custom-Mechanical-Keyboard-Hall-Effect-Gateron-Double-Rail-Magnetic-Switch-QMK-2-4-GHz-Bluetooth-5-2-RGB-Compat%2F16532107543]\n[Product: Govee Uplighter Floor Lamp | https://govee.sjv.io/c/482924/3014037/12845?u=https%3A%2F%2Fus.govee.com%2Fproducts%2Fgovee-uplighter-floor-lamp]\n[Product: Kobo Libra Colour | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fkobo-libra-colour--ereader--7-glare-free-colour-e-ink-kaleido-3-display--dark-mode-option--waterproof-2024-white%2FJXSHPC3Q96, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fus.kobobooks.com%2Fproducts%2Fkobo-libra-colour, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fkobo-libra-colour-7-32gb-ereader-glare-free-colour-e-ink-kaleido-3-display-dark-mode-option-audiobooks-waterproof%2F-%2FA-91830243]\n[Product: iPad (2025) | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DZ75HDQ4/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Dbrand Killswitch - Switch 2 | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fdbrand-killswitch-travel-case-for-nintendo-switch-2-black%2FJ89GJY738K%2Fsku%2F6643495, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fdbrand.com%2Fshop%2Fkillswitch%2Fnintendo-switch-2-cases]\n[Product: Godox ES45 key light | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0915RDS44?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bhphotovideo.com%2Fc%2Fproduct%2F1626329-REG%2Fgodox_es45_kit_e_sports_es45_led_light.html, https://doddcamera.com/gdx14100]\n[Product: Moto Tag 2 | https://www.anrdoezrs.net/links/8836598/type/dlg/https://www.motorola.com/us/en/p/motoaccessories/moto-tag-2/pg38c08032, https://www.anrdoezrs.net/links/8836598/type/dlg/https://www